{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"text_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Implemented the cross-package interface repair.\n\n- Updated `packages/orders/orders/adapter.py`:\n  - New `Product` objects read prices from `product.price.amount_cents`.\n  - New currencies read from `product.price.currency`.\n  - Legacy dictionaries continue using `price_cents` and optional `currency`.\n  - Existing mixed-currency rejection remains enforced.\n\n- Wrote the report to `out/interface_fix_report.md`.\n\nVerification:\n- Direct smoke checks passed for:\n  - `Money`-backed products\n  - Legacy product dictionaries\n  - Currency-grouped reports\n  - Mixed-currency order rejection\n- Changed source compiled successfully with `python3 -m py_compile`.\n- Requested `python -m pytest tests` was attempted, but this environment has no `python` executable. `python3` is available but has no installed `pytest` module."}}
